所以这里我们尝试上传一个.php3后缀的脚本文件。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat3/2.19.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;751&#34;
	height=&#34;332&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat3/2.19_hu_fd530107b01a04cc.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat3/2.19_hu_2019defa2aadcde1.jpg 1024w&#34;
